<title>POLAND: Kredyt Bank to up stake in Polisa Zycie.</title>
<headline>Kredyt Bank to up stake in Polisa Zycie.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish bank Kredyt Bank SA plans to raise its stake in life insurer Polisa Zycie SA to 26 percent from the current 15.9 percent, Kredyt Bank said in a statement late on Friday.</p>
<p>The bank did not say from whom it would buy shares but said that after the transaction it would become the third main shareholder in Polisa Zycie along with France's Caisse Nationale de Prevoyance Assurances SA and Polisa SA.</p>
<p>The French firm currently holds 46 percent of Polisa Zycie shares, Polisa SA 26 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
